   "cooked": "<p>In my opinion the hatch video should be more like a <strong>hype/manifesto</strong> video than an explanatory video. These are good examples:</p>\n<p><strong>DarkWallet</strong><br/>\n</p><div class=\"onebox lazyYT lazyYT-container\" data-parameters=\"feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque\" data-youtube-id=\"Ouo7Q6Cf_yc\" data-youtube-title=\"Dark Wallet\">\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ouo7Q6Cf_yc\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img class=\"ytp-thumbnail-image\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/18d85e128ed012e0add8c5992bb36cc496b26582.jpeg\" title=\"Dark Wallet\" width=\"480\"/>\n</a>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Aragon Fight for Freedom</strong><br/>\n</p><div class=\"onebox lazyYT lazyYT-container\" data-parameters=\"feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque\" data-youtube-id=\"AqjIWmiAidw\" data-youtube-title=\"Aragon - The fight for freedom\">\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AqjIWmiAidw\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img class=\"ytp-thumbnail-image\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/01d30ce490f8990cc2e133ef36f1c9990d7324fd.jpeg\" title=\"Aragon - The fight for freedom\" width=\"690\"/>\n</a>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Daostack</strong><br/>\n</p><div class=\"onebox lazyYT lazyYT-container\" data-parameters=\"feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque\" data-youtube-id=\"rGFTeW6QBSo\" data-youtube-title=\"Introducing DAOstack (v2)\">\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rGFTeW6QBSo\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img class=\"ytp-thumbnail-image\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/95f4a13518dc333e68b2e56eecac4286ea84f379.jpeg\" title=\"Introducing DAOstack (v2)\" width=\"690\"/>\n</a>\n</div>\n<p>Here there are some ideas for the TEC video:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Expose the purpose of token engineering, why it’s needed in the space</li>\n<li>Multiple voices in off talking from the perspective of the TEC DAO.</li>\n<li>Do cool special effects with the voices, maybe getting a progressively robotic, or joining some of them as they go on.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I’d love to hear more ideas, and if somebody has experience in audio/video editing, please step forward! Let’s build it together, as a DAO <img alt=\":sun_with_face:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/sun_with_face.png?v=9\" title=\":sun_with_face:\"/></p>",
